ade de colici.</div>\n<div align=\"left\"></div>\n<div align=\"left\">\n\n<strong>Produse farmaceutice indicate:</strong>\n<ul>\n	<li>CARBOCIT BEBE X 10 PLICULETE - BIOFARM</li>\n</ul>\n<table width=\"700\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"150\"><strong>Imagine</strong></td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"550\"><strong>Descriere</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://localhost/Produse%20Farmaceutice/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/carbocit.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-73\" alt=\"carbocit\" src=\"http://localhost/Produse%20Farmaceutice/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/carbocit-300x300.jpg\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" /></a></td>\n<td align=\"center\">Carbocit BEBE este o combinatie de extracte naturale de plante traditionale folosite in calmarea colicilor ce apar la sugari (atat in cazul copiilor alaptati la san cat si a celor alimentati cu formule de lapte) sau la copiii mici, precum si a durerilor abdominale si balonarilor ce pot aparea in cursul diversificarii alimentatiei copilului, la introducerea unui aliment nou in dieta.\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Mod de administrare:</strong>\n\nSe utilizeaza cate 1-2 pliculete pe zi la copii.\n\nPulberea continuta intr-un pliculet se dizolva in 50-75 ml de apa.\n\n&nbsp;\n\n<strong>Mod de prezentare:</strong> Cutie cu 10 pliculete.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n	<li>Alinan baby drink 20 plicuri + 6 plicuri gratuit</li>\n</ul>\n<table width=\"700\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"150\">Imagine</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"550\">Descriere</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://localhost/Produse%20Farmaceutice/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/alinan-baby-drink-20-plicuri-6-plicuri-gratuit-10022385.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-74\" alt=\"alinan-baby-drink-20-plicuri-6-plicuri-gratuit-10022385\" src=\"http://localhost/Produse%20Farmaceutice/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/alinan-baby-drink-20-plicuri-6-plicuri-gratuit-10022385.jpg\" width=\"183\" height=\"200\" /></a></td>\n<td align=\"center\">-ALINAN BABY DRINK 20 plicuri\n\n-3 grame/plic\n\n-FITERMAN\n\n-Avantaje:\n•ajuta bebelusul sa se linisteasca si sa depaseasca mai usor etapele specifice perioadei de crestere si dezvoltare\n\n-Compozitie:\n-Un plic contine:\n-0,0875 g extract din flori de musetel (Matricaria chamomilla) standardizat in apigenol\n-0,02 g extract din frunze de melisa (Melissa officinalis) standardizat in acid rozmarinic\n-0,0015 g ulei purificat de anason stelat (Illicum verum) standardizat in trans-anetol si fructoza\n\n-Nu contine aromatizanti artificiali, coloranti sau conservanti!\n\n-Valoarea energetica:\n-11,56 kcal/plic.\n\n-Indicatii terapeutice:\n-ALINAN BABY DRINK se recomanda sugarilor si copiilor pentru a alina colicile abdominale, pentru a regla tranzitul intestinal si pentru a ameliora starile de disconfort si agitatie care apar in diferite etape de crestere: eruptii dentare, administrare de vaccinuri, etc.\n\n-ALINAN BABY DRINK poate fi folosit, de asemenea, intre mese in loc de ceai.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<ul>\n	<li>Infacol 50ML</li>\n</ul>\n<table width=\"700\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"150\">Imagine</td>\n<td align=\"center\" width=\"550\">Descriere</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://localhost/Produse%20Farmaceutice/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/infacol.jpg\"><img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-75\" alt=\"infacol\" src=\"http://localhost/Produse%20Farmaceutice/wp-content/uploads/2013/06/infacol-174x300.jpg\" width=\"174\" height=\"300\" /></a></td>\n<td align=\"center\">Infacol contine simeticone.Ajuta la eliberarea gazelor, calmeaza colicile si crampele stomacale ale bebelusilor.Poate fi folosit inca de la nastere.Nu contine zahar,alcool si coloranti.\nAdministrare:o pipeta plina inainte de fiecare masa.Agitati flaconul inainte de utilizare.</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>', 'Colici copii', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'open', '', '72-revision', '', '', '2013-06-24 13:57:59', '2013-06-24 13:57:59', '', 72, 'http://localhost/Produse%20Farmaceutice/?p=76', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
